Z||000004||86SE||02-02-2000||11:25 PM||||I got my 1986 SE V-6 auto 2m6, in March of '99.....My sister (21) always drove it to our house on the First time I saw one at school ('84 2m4) I knew I had to have one.  Then my sister GAVE me her $3000+ Fiero!!  She just threw me the keys on March 12th 11:47 PM CST.  When it was in Omaha, NE some one hit the left rear qtr panel with a baseball bat, stole the ground effects, stole the front emblem, and cracked both qtr. windows!!  Since then I replaced every single part that was missing or damaged and got a hell of a stereo system from her!!  For Christmas she gave me an Autoteck ix800 800 Watt amplifier, and a Petras 700 watt 10" sub woofer.....<P>My Fiero has ground effects, rocker panels, brand new lower profile tires, chromed rims, rear spoiler, cd player, power everything, embroidered seats, custom 3rd brake light, custom red painted dash pieces, new dual chrome ANSA exhaust tips, and soon to be painted a sweet canarie yellow!!<P>Oh yeah, I got the Fiero when I was 14 and now i'm the ripe old age of 15......There are some good things about living in South Dakota.........||||reg||6
